### Sports Field Booking System — HTTP Requests
### Compatible with IntelliJ IDEA HTTP Client and VS Code REST Client extension.
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### USAGE:
###   1. Run the app (mvn spring-boot:run)
###   2. Execute the Login request first — copy the token into @token below.
###   3. Run any other request in order.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@token = PASTE_JWT_TOKEN_HERE


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### AUTH
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### 1. Login — get JWT token
# Expected: 200 OK with { "token": "...", "tokenType": "Bearer", "expiresIn": 86400000 }
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

###

### 2. Login — bad credentials (should 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "wrongpassword"
}

###

### 3. Access protected endpoint without token (should 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/fields


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### FIELDS
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### 4. Create outdoor soccer field
# Expected: 201 Created
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/fields
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Stade Anfa",
  "sportType": "SOCCER",
  "indoor": false,
  "pricePerHour": 150.00,
  "latitude": 33.5731,
  "longitude": -7.5898
}

###

### 5. Create indoor basketball court
# Expected: 201 Created
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/fields
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Salle Omnisports",
  "sportType": "BASKETBALL",
  "indoor": true,
  "pricePerHour": 200.00,
  "latitude": 33.5731,
  "longitude": -7.5898
}

###

### 6. Create outdoor tennis court
# Expected: 201 Created
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/fields
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Court Central",
  "sportType": "TENNIS",
  "indoor": false,
  "pricePerHour": 80.00,
  "latitude": 33.5731,
  "longitude": -7.5898
}

###

### 7. List all fields
# Expected: 200 OK with array of fields
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/fields
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 8. Get field by ID
# Expected: 200 OK with single field
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/fields/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 9. Get non-existent field (should 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/fields/9999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 10. Update a field
# Expected: 200 OK with updated field
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/fields/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Stade Anfa - Terrain A",
  "sportType": "SOCCER",
  "indoor": false,
  "pricePerHour": 175.00,
  "latitude": 33.5731,
  "longitude": -7.5898
}

###

### 11. Create field with validation error (missing required fields — should 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/fields
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "indoor": true
}

###

### 12. Delete a field (use an ID you don't need)
# Expected: 204 No Content
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/fields/3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### RESERVATIONS
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### 13. Create first reservation on outdoor field — slot 09:00-11:00
# For outdoor fields, expects weather > 10°C on the date.
# Expected: 201 Created (if weather permits) or 409 if temp ≤ 10°C
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fieldId": 1,
  "clientName": "Youssef Alami",
  "clientPhone": "+212 6 12 34 56 78",
  "clientEmail": "youssef@example.com",
  "date": "2026-09-20",
  "startHour": 9,
  "endHour": 11
}

###

### 14. DOUBLE-BOOKING TEST — same field, same slot (should 409 Conflict)
# This is the most important debugging test. If you get 201 instead, the overlap check is broken.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fieldId": 1,
  "clientName": "Another Client",
  "clientPhone": "+212 6 99 88 77 66",
  "clientEmail": "another@example.com",
  "date": "2026-09-20",
  "startHour": 9,
  "endHour": 11
}

###

### 15. PARTIAL OVERLAP TEST — starts inside existing 09-11 slot (should 409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fieldId": 1,
  "clientName": "Overlap Client",
  "clientPhone": "+212 6 11 22 33 44",
  "clientEmail": "overlap@example.com",
  "date": "2026-09-20",
  "startHour": 10,
  "endHour": 12
}

###

### 16. ADJACENT SLOT — starts exactly when previous ends (should 201, NOT a conflict)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fieldId": 1,
  "clientName": "Adjacent Client",
  "clientPhone": "+212 6 55 66 77 88",
  "clientEmail": "adjacent@example.com",
  "date": "2026-09-20",
  "startHour": 11,
  "endHour": 13
}

###

### 17. Create reservation on indoor field (no weather check)
# Expected: 201 Created regardless of temperature
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fieldId": 2,
  "clientName": "Fatima Zahra",
  "clientPhone": "+212 6 00 11 22 33",
  "clientEmail": "fatima@example.com",
  "date": "2026-09-20",
  "startHour": 14,
  "endHour": 16
}

###

### 18. Get reservations for a field on a date
# Expected: 200 OK with list of reservations
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reservations?fieldId=1&date=2026-09-20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 19. Get single reservation by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reservations/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 20. Get non-existent reservation (should 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reservations/9999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 21. Reservation with invalid hours — startHour > endHour (should 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fieldId": 1,
  "clientName": "Bad Hours Client",
  "clientPhone": "+212 6 00 00 00 00",
  "clientEmail": "bad@example.com",
  "date": "2026-09-20",
  "startHour": 14,
  "endHour": 10
}

###

### 22. Reservation for non-existent field (should 404)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fieldId": 9999,
  "clientName": "Ghost Client",
  "clientPhone": "+212 6 00 00 00 00",
  "clientEmail": "ghost@example.com",
  "date": "2026-09-20",
  "startHour": 9,
  "endHour": 11
}
